## Operating System System-Level Junk Files
## ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS specific desktop workspace metadata
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows specific folder thumbnail caches
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
